/T (The Fast Fourier Transform \(FFT\) is a mathematical algorithm that converts the PPG signal from its original Time Domain \(amplitude over time\) to the Frequency Domain \(power distribution across frequencies\). It Identifies the dominant frequency peak. It separates the primary cardiac component from low-frequency baseline wander and high-frequency sensor noise and considers the entire window.)
